# cyberserious host filter, loaded as the anchor "cyberserious"
set skip on lo0

table <cyberserious_bad> persist

block drop in quick from <cyberserious_bad> to any
block drop in quick on !lo0 all

pass in quick on lo0 proto tcp from any to 127.0.0.1 port { 8100, 8101, 8200, 8443 }

pass out quick all keep state
